# dense-1/8: Qwen3-8B DSpark dense drafter with a 1/8-width MLP

Branch `dense-1/8` of https://github.com/yushengsu-thu/SpecForge (based on `spark-Qwen3-8B`).
One experiment: the Qwen3-8B dense DSpark drafter of the dense-vs-MoE comparison
(`docs/recipes/qwen3-8b-dspark-moe-disaggregated.md`) with the draft MLP hidden dim cut
to 1/8, trained for 12 epochs on the Open Perfect Blend regen corpus.

| Link | |
| --- | --- |
| Code / config | this branch: `configs/qwen3-8b-dspark-dense-1-8-noconf-b16.json` + the launch yaml below |
| W&B (one line for all 12 epochs) | https://wandb.ai/eigent_radixark_training/specforge-qwen3-8b-dspark-dense/runs/dense-1-8-1server-dp7 (display name `dense-1-8`) |
| Checkpoints (one folder per epoch) | https://huggingface.co/yushengsu/dense-1-8 (`epoch-01/` ... `epoch-12/`, each a `specforge export`ed servable directory) |
| Machine | one 8x H200 node (`specforge-dsv4-h200`, cluster h200-sci-k8s-1), SGLang 0.5.18 + spec-capture patch, torch 2.13.0+cu130 |
| Launch yaml | `examples/configs/online/disaggregated/managed-local/qwen3-8b-dspark-dense-1-8-noconf-b16-perfectblend-1server-dp7-disaggregated.yaml` |

## Target

| | |
| --- | --- |
| target | `Qwen/Qwen3-8B` (36 layers, hidden 4096, vocab 151936), bf16, served by SGLang capture servers |
| embedding | draft uses the target `model.embed_tokens.weight` (`load_target_embedding: true`) and the target `lm_head` |
| target feature layers | 1, 9, 17, 25, 33 (`dspark` projector: 5 x 4096 -> 4096) |

## Draft model (`configs/qwen3-8b-dspark-dense-1-8-noconf-b16.json`)

| | dense arm (`qwen3-8b-dspark-noconf-b16.json`) | **dense-1/8 (this run)** |
| --- | --- | --- |
| architecture | DSparkDraftModel, bidirectional attention inside the block | same |
| block_size | 16 | 16 |
| layers | 5, all full attention | 5, all full attention |
| residual hidden | 4096 (= target hidden) | 4096 (unchanged: tied to the target embed_tokens / lm_head / projector) |
| **MLP intermediate_size** | 12288 | **1536 (1/8)** |
| attention | GQA 32 heads / 8 KV heads, head_dim 128 | same |
| Markov head | vanilla, rank 256 | same |
| confidence head | off (`enable_confidence_head: false`, alpha 0) | same |
| mask_token_id | 151669 | same |
| rope_theta / max_position_embeddings | 1e6 / 40960 | same |
| vocab | 151936, `tie_word_embeddings: false` | same |
| parameters (5 layers + projector + Markov head) | ~1.05B | ~0.47B |

`is_causal`, `dspark_flatten_projection`, `dspark_cache_projection` and `ddp_bucket_cap_mb`
(the unmerged PR #942 keys) are deliberately not used, same as the dense arm.

